        "func": "let raw = msg.payload.toString();\n\n// Split by commas\nlet parts = raw.split(\",\");\n\n// Make sure the expected value exists\nif (parts.length < 2) return null;\n\n// Get weight (second value)\nlet weight = parseFloat(parts[1]);\n\n// Ignore invalid readings\nif (isNaN(weight)) return null;\n\n// Output ONLY the weight\nmsg.payload = weight;\n\nreturn msg;",
